        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "So these are the only ones left of His Majesty's bloodline?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Those wretched women were quick at their handiwork. This is the best we can do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "I still say that we shouldn't be treating His Majesty's melodies so frivolously\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "What do you think we should do, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "I think we should be a little more cautious here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Cautious? Our people are being slaughtered day after day, and you want to be cautious? This is our last chance!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Even if bringing His Majesty's bloodline and melodies won't revive all of His Majesty's powers, at the very least..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "text": "How... How old am I? Two? Three?"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the middle of a rundown building, I look around at my surroundings, bewildered."
    },
    {
        "text": "The man who brought me here told me that both my father and mother had already been lynched. At the time, I didn't even understand what lynching and death meant."
    },
    {
        "text": "He even told me that, from here on out, this would be my home. I was going to be part of a grand plan, and if luck was on my side, I could even become Leithanien's next ruler."
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't get it. I don't get any of it at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing I understood in my confusion was that I probably wouldn't ever get to go back to my room, where sunlight beamed in every morning."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "Didn't I tell you already? It's impossible to make a person into a vessel for the Voice of Mundane!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "You knew it was impossible? Did you let any of us know you were against the plan before we started, then? And now only after they started to bite the dust are you complaining? Don't make me laugh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "No, I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Let me tell you. This isn't a waste. This is a price we must pay for our success."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "As long as one of them survives, we won't have to hide out here in the provinces like thieves!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Victoria, Ursus, Kazimierz... There are more parties interested in our plans than we can count! As long as we succeed, their armies will help secure our revenge against those awful women!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "text": "That day, the lady who had been taking care of us disappeared."
    },
    {
        "text": "Once she was gone, the men who brought us our meals but didn't stay with us started arguing with each other."
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't understand what they were arguing about. All I knew was that the lady who sang songs for us probably wasn't going to be back again."
    },
    {
        "text": "If I remember correctly, this is how the song goes:"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sky is blue and fine,"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Breeze lilts by in Song;"
    },
    {
        "text": "The River murmurs clear,"
    },
    {
        "text": "My Heart is filled with Hope."
    },
    {
        "text": "I think there was more to the song, but she never sang that part to us."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
