        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "What is it this time? Out with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "That's another one of them, dead..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "So what? We're making progress!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Next time, we'll move the operating room farther away and add some soundproofing material... We'll definitely get there!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "text": "The weather got cold, and then warm."
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, those men would make a huge ruckus whenever someone disappeared."
    },
    {
        "text": "They gradually complained less and less. Our meals got worse, too, but at least we were able to fill our stomachs, thanks to there being fewer mouths to feed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps this is just how man is meant to be. Before you know it, they disappear."
    },
    {
        "text": "And so did their things, too."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the cane that belonged to the old granny, the music box that belonged to a boy, the wand and Originium dice that belonged to an older man..."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there were also things that stayed with us, like the song that the girl liked to sing."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a boy who learned the song, and he liked humming it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
