            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "Just... Just what are we doing?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "We brought His Majesty's bloodline under our protection, only to... only to send them to their deaths..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Wake up! This is a necessary price to pay! To make sure His Majesty's bloodkin can wield His power properly, we have to make these sacrifices!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "We are learning more and more about the Voice of Mundane. We'll succeed soon enough!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "What about those who died?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "No, let's stop these crazy experiments... Let's start over with new identities and raise the few we have left. They might just grow up to become fine men like His Majesty..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Stop dreaming! We need the Voice of Mundane!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, after a year, or perhaps two... I really have no idea."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was just me and the boy."
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd start trembling in fear every time those men came to our room."
    },
    {
        "text": "When he saw that, the boy would comfort me and tell me that everything was alright, before standing in front of them."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, as soon as they were gone, he would sing the song."
    },
    {
        "text": "'My Heart is filled with Hope.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "You two have been here for a long time. You may be kids, but you've figured it out already, haven't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "You're His Majesty's only surviving bloodkin, after all. I don't want to make this too ugly. I'll let you decide who will be next."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "We've made vast improvements to our technology... It might succeed... most likely. Whichever of you that undergoes the experiment... might become a really, truly amazing Caster."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "text": "We weren't stupid."
    },
    {
        "text": "The man in the noble attire told us the same thing the few times before that, but none of the ones who left with him ever came back."
    },
    {
        "text": "My legs trembled. I looked to the boy next to me. His lips were pale, too."
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't want to disappear, nor did I want him to disappear, but..."
    },
    {
        "text": "He noticed my gaze and turned to me, and spoke those words as his lips trembled:"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I'll do it.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I heard him say that, I couldn't keep myself upright anymore. My legs gave out, and I fell to the ground."
    },
    {
        "command": "musicvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.2,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
