    },
    {
        "text": "I lived alone in the empty room for two whole months."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, on a rainy night, they brought the boy back. His eyes were closed, and he bit his lips hard, but he was alive."
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought it was a miracle, but mere days later, he was taken from the room again, never to be seen again. Just like the others."
    },
    {
        "text": "He was still humming the song before he left."
    },
    {
        "text": "'My Heart is filled with Hope.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_ltstrongpoint",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
