            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A few days came and went, and it was finally my turn."
    },
    {
        "text": "I followed those two. On our way, I saw many rooms that I had never seen before. There were all kinds of devices and equipment inside."
    },
    {
        "text": "We arrived at a small room that was completely white inside."
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman in the spire caster attire told me to lie down on the bed. She was wearing a white surgical mask and gloves and had a very strange feel to them."
    },
    {
        "text": "She put a mask over my face, and that was the last thing I remember."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_black",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was woken up by their cheers."
    },
    {
        "text": "When I awakened, it felt like there was lava burning in my brain and roasting my eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "The pain lasted... how long was it? Days? Weeks? Months?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_ltstrongpoint",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nevertheless, as time went on, the pain slowly weakened. In the end, I would get bouts of intense pain that quickly subsided."
    },
    {
        "text": "I waited for them to carry me outside like everybody else, but they didn't."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not only that, they started to fawn on me, gave me more food, and let me run outside in the courtyard."
    },
    {
        "text": "They started giving me lessons to teach me how to read, write, and most importantly, use Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "text": "Very solemnly, they gave me the wand and Originium dice that belonged to the old man and told me to cherish them, as they were a part of His Majesty's collection."
    },
    {
        "text": "Thereafter, whenever I showed any aptitude for Arts, they would shower me with praise."
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, those days didn't last very long."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
