        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "Is this... all we'll get with this boy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "From the looks of it, even if we pushed him to his limits, he would only be able to arm wrestle a single Empresses' Voice fighter."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "Perhaps we should adjust his 'Voice of Mundane' energy fluctuations like the last one..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "Forget it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "What're you afraid of? If we improv\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "You can't!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "You dare talk back to me?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "We had so many verses of 'Voice of Mundane,' and this is the only one that can still be played. We had fifteen of His Majesty's bloodkin, and this boy is the only one left!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "If we raise him right, we might yet be able to flee to another country and buy ourselves official appointments there, and, more importantly, His Majesty's bloodline will continue."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cowardly Noble",
        "text": "If he ends up buggered like the other kid, then the only way we'll have to make it up to His Majesty is by taking our own lives!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_491_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reckless Caster",
        "text": "......"
    },
