    {
        "text": "The next day, they were gone too."
    },
    {
        "text": "They didn't take their own lives. Rather, it was because the Empresses' Voice they kept talking about were here."
    },
    {
        "text": "When I sat in the empty room and listened to the screams outside, I couldn't help but feel a sense a joy."
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, they all loved to talk about 'His Majesty's bloodline.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now what they feared the most, the destruction of this cursed bloodline, was finally about to happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_doorbreak",
            "volume": 0.8
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "An elegantly dressed man kicked the door in and entered."
    },
    {
        "text": "This must be the Empresses' Voice."
    },
    {
        "text": "He looked at me and neither lowered his weapon nor attacked. He was probably hesitating?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hesitating for what?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I picked up my wand and pointed it at the Empresses' Voice, and the Originium dice started to revolve around me."
    },
    {
        "text": "As I expected, he dashed toward me unbelievably quickly and struck the brass instrument on my head hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
