    {
        "text": "That strike was the very thing that divided my short life into two wildly different halves."
    },
    {
        "text": "Graf Urtica has forgotten how he found himself handcuffed to this chair. His frequent headaches serve as the only reminder that the Witch King's final melody yet lives in his head."
    },
    {
        "text": "His regent, managing the Grafschaft, has told him with scorn that it is an artifact left behind by 'the one whose name we dare not speak', and that it is no longer separable from his body."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he has no idea at all how he became one with that thing."
    },
    {
        "text": "He remembers now."
    },
    {
        "text": "What should he do?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What can I do?"
    },
